}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Mitra Kerja Riset
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/mitra-kerja-riset/all`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil semua mitra",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "nama": "PT. Mitra Teknologi"
      },
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "nama": "Bank Mandiri"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  **Note:** Endpoint ini tanpa pagination, cocok untuk dropdown.
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
